    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a fine or forfeiture imposed under an Act of Parliament"

-- src:16268 | (2) An order for remission under subsection (1) may include the remission of costs incurred in the proceedings, but no costs to which a private prosecutor is entitled shall be remitted.
